        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo to Rwoth waco ran ama: Waci ri ji ni Rwoth pa lwak jolweny, Were pa Isiraili waco ama: Medhi win, mer win to wiŋok. Podhi win piny to meni loyo win ma ay, kwoŋbedo abor m'adhiro i dier win.",
          "type": "text",
