          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole acako kelo rerok kwoŋ tindi paran madwoŋ, aka winonyali geŋo nedi gir'acula? Ak'owey m'akimiyo win gir'acula, kwoŋbedo alwoŋo abor kwoŋ ji je ma jobedo i piny, Rwoth pa lwak jolweny waco.",
          "type": "text",
